OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,8,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,9,     Fwith familiar favourites.
OL,10,G1300 Classical Live
OL,11,     FElizabeth Alker introduces
OL,12,     Fhighlights from the Proms,
OL,13,     Fincluding music by Prokofiev,
OL,14,     Fchamber performances from this
OL,15,     Fyear's Ryedale Festival and
OL,16,     FBaroque music from Fribourg.
OL,17,G1600 Composer of the Week: Mozart
OL,18,     FKate Molleson explores Mozart's
OL,19,     Frelationship with his sister
OL,20,     FNannerl, from their close bond in
OL,21,     Fchildhood to estrangement by the
OL,22,     Fend of their lives.
